          "type": "text",
          "text": "The number line shows the solution of -3<px+1≤15, where p is a positive constant. Find p."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
      "primary_outcome": "7.6",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
